\par\par \b \uc2 Press Release: \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2  Named Exemplary in the 2026 Customer Experience Management Buyers Guide by ISG Research\b0\par\par\uc2 557 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 June 2026\par 14:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 ISG Research recognizes \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2 's Unified-CXM platform for strength across AI, analytics, and customer journey management. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--June 29, 2026-- \f28 \par \par \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2  (NYSE: CXM), the definitive, AI-native platform for Unified Customer Experience Management (Unified-CXM), today announced that it has been named an Exemplary Provider in the 2026 ISG Buyers Guide(TM) for Customer Experience Management and recognized as a Leader in Capability, one of only three providers to earn that distinction.\par \par \uc2 The ISG Customer Experience Management Buyers Guide evaluated software providers on their ability to meet enterprise requirements across product experience (capability and platform) and customer experience. \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2  was rated above the median in both dimensions, resulting in its placement in the "Exemplary" category.\par \par \uc2 "Customer experience is no longer defined by individual interactions, but by how well companies orchestrate value across the entire customer lifecycle," said \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2  Chief Product and Strategy Officer Karthik Suri. "Being named 'Exemplary' and a Capability Leader in this year's ISG Buyers Guide reinforces our focus on helping enterprises unify engagement, insights, and action on a single AI-native platform."\par \par \uc2 According to ISG Research, the CXM market is undergoing a shift from fragmented, department-centric tools to unified platforms that support journey orchestration, AI-driven decisioning, and lifecycle analytics. \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2  pioneered the category for Unified-CXM, and the \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2  platform is purpose-built to address this shift, enabling organizations to manage customer experiences across the front office in a single system.\par \par \uc2 "\uc2 Sprinklr\uc2 's strengths come from melding a modern enterprise back-office platform with a series of newer applications specifically targeted to unify and extend control over many of the siloed functions that create fragmented customer experiences," states Keith Dawson, authoring analyst. "The company's development pathways have emphasized reliability, strong compliance features, and the creation of natively integrated apps that minimize administrative and deployment headaches."\par \par \uc2 As enterprises increasingly prioritize unified approaches to customer experience, the ISG report highlights the importance of platforms that can connect data, teams, and workflows across channels. \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2 's platform is designed to meet these demands, helping global organizations deliver consistent, data-driven experiences at scale.\par \par \uc2 To learn more, download the full 2026 ISG Buyers Guide(TM) for Customer Experience Management for detailed insights into how the vendors were evaluated and what enterprise buyers should consider when selecting a CXM platform.\par \par \uc2 About \uc2 Sprinklr\par \par \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2  is the definitive, AI-native platform for Unified Customer Experience Management (Unified-CXM), empowering brands to deliver extraordinary experiences at scale -- across every customer touchpoint.\par \par \uc2 By combining human intelligence with the enhancements and insights of \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2  helps brands earn trust and loyalty through personalized, seamless, and efficient customer interactions. \uc2 Sprinklr\uc2 's unified platform provides powerful solutions for every customer-facing team -- spanning social media management, marketing, advertising, customer feedback, and omnichannel contact center management -