\par\par \b \uc2 Soitec\uc2  Shares Climb on Partnership With China's ZenSemi\b0\par\par\uc2 By Mauro Orru \par \uc2 322 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 June 2026\par 12:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 Soitec\uc2  shares jumped after the French semiconductor-materials maker said it would work with Chinese integrated circuit maker ZenSemi on advanced chip-making technology for \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  data centers, humanoid robots, electric vehicles and industrial equipment.\par \par \uc2 Soitec\uc2  said it would supply ZenSemi with its 300-millimeter power-silicon-on-insulator substrates that the Chinese group will use to expand production of integrated circuits based on technology that allows high- and low-voltage components to be densely integrated onto a single chip.\par \par \uc2 Ruby Yan, vice president of sales and marketing at ZenSemi, said the technology, known as BCD-on-SOI, would help both domestic Chinese chip designers and international clients to build smaller, more robust, cost-optimized integrated circuits for AI, autos and other industries.\par \par \uc2 Soitec\uc2  shares in Paris gained more than 5% on Monday. The stock is up more than fivefold since the year began, propelled by investor fervor around AI that lifted semiconductor stocks to new highs in recent months. Companies are pledging hundreds of billions of dollars in capital expenditures to build AI infrastructure that requires increasingly sophisticated semiconductors.\par \par \uc2 Steve Babureck\uc2 , \uc2 Soitec\uc2 's U.S. operations president and chief strategy officer, said in an interview last month that the AI capex cycle was unprecedented in the history of semiconductors and that \uc2 Soitec\uc2  was fortunate that the focus at the moment is on data centers.\par \par \uc2 Headquartered just outside Grenoble in southeastern France, \uc2 Soitec\uc2  produces semiconductor materials known as substrates that serve as the base layer upon which the integrated circuits and chips that are found in smartphones, tablets and data centers are built. \uc2 Soitec\uc2  sells its products to foundries--businesses like ZenSemi that have the facilities to produce semiconductors for the companies that designed and commissioned them.\par \par \uc2 Write to Mauro Orru at mauro.orru@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 29, 2026 06:16 ET (10:16 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260629em6t00152\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
